<title>USA: MGE deliverable HRS wheat stocks.</title>
<headline>MGE deliverable HRS wheat stocks.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS, MN 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Minneapolis Grain Exchange reported stocks of hard red spring wheat in deliverable position as of Oct 25, in 000 bushels. Stocks in exchange approved elevators deliverable against MGE futures. Deliverable and non-deliverable grades exclude CCC stocks.</p>
<p>						Oct 25   WEEK    YEAR</p>
<p>							   AGO     AGO</p>
<p>						   MINNEAPOLIS AREA</p>
<p>Deliverable				 2,472   2,739   2,408</p>
<p>Non-deliverable				 7	 7   1,024</p>
<p>CCC stocks				     21	21	34</p>
<p>Total					 2,500   2,767   3,466</p>
<p>						   DULUTH/SUPERIOR</p>
<p>Deliverable				 9,074  10,193  12,173</p>
<p>Non-deliverable			     907     591   2,806</p>
<p>CCC stocks				    633     633     995</p>
<p>Total					10,614  11,417  15,974</p>
<p>Note: Minneapolis area includes Minneapolis/St Paul/Red Wing. (Chicago newsdesk 312 983 7278)</p>
